  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>为什么树苗会从树叶里掉出来？我也不知道。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>是时候终结这种现象了！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#e67e23\"><strong>（无需启动光影修复模组！）</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/813371740276391946/942430753520771122/oakloglong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"36\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>功能</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-将物品栏中的树苗纹理改为对应的树种</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-将树苗的名称改为\"种子\"（中文）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-地面上的树苗外观保持不变</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"font-size:14px\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/813371740276391946/942430753520771122/oakloglong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"36\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/432/318/seedsa1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/813371740276391946/942430753520771122/oakloglong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感谢<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>动态树木</strong></a>模组的作者ferreusveritas提供的精美纹理 =D</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如有反馈或请求，请在评论区留言，我会尽力帮助您。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
